      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="f2_title">Hover these.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="f2_lead">A button has two separate choices. The face is the daisyUI variant that owns the resting look. The effect is a <code class="font-code text-base">sw-btn-fx-*</code> class for the hover. Motion effects work on any face. Reveal effects rest as your face and bring in the accent on hover, best on an outline or ghost button. Face effects are the look themselves. This site's default is <code class="font-code text-base">lift</code>; a class on a button overrides it.</p>
    </div>
